 <COL N="0522C"></COL> kaiú thðû tavxewû sunevbh eiønai sugklhvrouû. Kaiú aællhé
ceiriú, «2O Qeovû se uJgihð diafulavtthé, ajdelfeú timiwvtate.»</FOREIGN></P> <P COM="0522"><FOREIGN LANG=Greek>2O aJgiwvtatoû ajrciepivskopoû eiøpe× Nuðn kaiú oiJ qeosebevstatoi
